# The rest of this repo has mixed line endings with core.autocrlf=false, so a
# global text=auto would renormalise the whole Kotlin/Rust tree the next time
# anyone touched it (see rules/line-endings.md). Scope it to this directory only:
# Zephyr/CMake tooling and the arm-none-eabi toolchain want LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.hex binary
*.uf2 binary
